WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.034
MATT SPENCER:
<i>You have to tell the people</i>

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:04.637
<i>that it's gonna be eight years
'til we're back to Earth.</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.372
If I tell the passengers

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:08.707
<i>that we are stuck up here
and the food is running out,</i>

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:11.477
<i>I'm going to become the next
 all you can eat buffet.</i>

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:13.813
 -AUTOMATED VOICE:
<i> Warning. Warning.</i>
-(ALL YELLING)

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.949
IRIS KIMURA:<i> Hello, Avenue 5.
 This is Mission Control.</i>

00:00:17.049 --> 00:00:18.184
<i> Is everything okay?</i>

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:20.753
Yeah. Everything's fine.

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:22.455
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.458
How can so much light
feel so dark?

00:00:25.524 --> 00:00:26.792
I agree.

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:27.993
It's my TV show.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.229
Why does he agree with
everything that's said to him?

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:32.265
-You hate agreeing.
-Exactly!

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.834 line:0%
Your sister died in space.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.303 line:0%
I can't look up at the sky
because it just reminds me
of her,

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.172 line:0%
so I can only look forward
or down now.

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:41.340
(GROANING)

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:43.343
-IRIS:<i> It's me.</i>
 -AUTOMATED VOICE 2:
<i> Welcome back, Iris.</i>

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.178
<i> Restoring smart seat
to your default settings.</i>

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.146
HERMAN JUDD:<i> Are you calling me
 from the toilet?</i>

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.648
When I do that,
I'm a goddamn animal.

00:00:49.748 --> 00:00:51.017
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:53.419
RAV MULCAIR:<i> Sorry.
We're heading into the sun.</i>

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:56.122
The big, yellow cancer factory
made out of lava. That one.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.124
Burn or starve?

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:59.659
Well, it's nice to have options.

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:03.029
You know, I think I preferred it
when it was chicken or fish.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:07.333
The twilight of the moron tyrant
is upon us!

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.469
I'm just a happy bride.

00:01:11.136 --> 00:01:14.207
I say... we sit here
and wait for death.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:15.408
<i> Pray for death.</i>

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.611
<i> Some combination of
 sitting and death.</i>

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:21.180
Sorry, I'm just internalizing
a lot of panic

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.381
-and fear right now.
-Yeah...

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:26.018
♪ (MUSIC BUILDS,
STOPS ABRUPTLY) ♪

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:28.588
-But now I've done that,
and I'm back in the room.
-Okay, good.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:32.092 line:0%
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

